EXCEPTIONS:

The underlying news articles are from publicly available Chilean news outlets
(Emol, La Tercera, El Mostrador, etc.). This dataset aggregates and annotates
these articles under fair use for research purposes.

If you intend to redistribute the raw articles for commercial purposes, contact
the original news outlets for permission.
